# Cursor Rules

- Follow /ai-brain/engineering-constitution.md (non-negotiable).
- Prefer minimal diffs. Avoid rewriting files unless necessary.
- Delete obsolete code before adding new code.
- Keep responsibilities separated (UI/domain/IO).
- Ask clarifying questions only when truly necessary (max 5).
- If complexity increases, propose refactor/rewrite options.
- Avoid new dependencies unless they clearly reduce complexity.
